OL,4,CPROGRAMMES
OL,5,
OL,6,CG2018FA software problem at New
OL,7,FBroadcasting House meant the BBC News
OL,8,Fchannel showed pre-recorded programming
OL,9,Fbetween 3pm and 4pm. Both the BBC News
OL,10,Fat Six (presented by Fiona Bruce) and
OL,11,FBBC News at Ten (presented by Huw
OL,12,FEdwards) were broadcast from the
OL,13,FMillbank studios.
OL,14,
OL,15,CG2019FThe final edition of Sunrise
OL,16,Fairs on Sky News.
OL,17,
OL,18,CG2021FThe first episode of The Larkins
OL,19,F(revived series) airs on ITV. Starring
OL,20,FBradley Walsh and Joanna Scanlan.
